│       │   │   ├── evaluate_population(offspring, problem)
│       │   │   ├── build_next_population(elites, offspring, config.population_size)
│       │   │   ├── update_best(best, population)
│       │   │   └── check_termination(population, best, config)
│       │   └── build_result(best, population, stop_status)
│       └── 输出
│           └── GAResult
│
└── 12_Data_Flow
    │
    └── 原始业务数据
        ↓
        create_problem()
